The '''Highroad Hijinx''' is a [[:Category:Difficulty 2|difficulty 2]] [[Dungeons|dungeon]] that is started by clicking on the fence in the [[Southern Wilds|southwest Wilds]], near [[Farnum's Farm]]. There is an icon on the [[Atlas]] for the Highroad Hijinx.

==Mobs==
===[[:Category:Enemies|Enemies]]===
*Hooligans
*Hooligan-At-Arms
*[[Collin]]

===[[Boss|Bosses]]===
*Mac

==Goals==
:Defeat Mac!
:Bonus: Destroy the Hooligan Weapon Racks! (4)

==Rewards==
