===Bonus Rewards===
Completion of the bonus goal, "Destroy the Hooligan Weapon Racks!", will grant all players in the instance an article of clothing from the sets listed below. The color and body part of the armor is random, but the armor will match the current job of the player receiving it.

:Archer: [[:Category:Point Blank|Point Blank]], [[:Category:Roving|Roving]]
:Brawler: [[:Category:Bum Rush|Bum Rush]], [[:Category:Peek-a-Boo|Peek-a-Boo]]
:Medic: [[:Category:Antibiotic|Antibiotic]], [[:Category:Urgent Care|Urgent Care]]
:Ninja: [[:Category:Nokizaru|Nokizaru]], [[:Category:Sekkou|Sekkou]]
:Warrior: [[:Category:Basic Attack|Basic Attack]], [[:Category:Second Wind|Second Wind]]
:Wizard: [[:Category:Hedge|Hedge]], [[:Category:Journeyman|Journeyman]]

